[01:43.98]WHY FORCE IT?
[01:44.92]Why force it?
[01:45.96]If it already hurts?
[01:47.74]Why force it?
[01:49.11]If everybody sees the crack?
[01:51.07]Why force it?
[01:52.22]WHY FORCE IT?
[01:53.40]Not everything that moves
[01:55.24]is moving forward.
[01:57.65]Not everything that breaks
[01:59.71]was built stronger.
