[02:23.43]Screen changes color.
[02:25.95]Room full of people
[02:27.74]waiting for an answer.
[02:30.23]Nobody says
[02:31.40]what everybody knows.
[02:32.73]Door closed too early.
[02:33.83]Road never checked.
[02:34.82]Warning came
[02:37.26]before the damage.
[02:39.03]But the calendar said:
